  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd the Explain G-code checkbox to the document and setup post pages.\nShow that explanations make the program longer.\nRoute edits through the existing undoable post-options commands.\nKeep the existing MCP tools and skill entries from #1534 unchanged.\nExtend the existing MCP test to cover setting Explain on a named setup.\nRecord the decision in docs/decisions/1390-explain-switch.md.\n\nBefore document:\n\n![Before document](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/0b0fd21839f5504f114603b71e25c951b94c4363/1390/before-document.png)\n\nAfter document:\n\n![After document](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/0b0fd21839f5504f114603b71e25c951b94c4363/1390/after-document.png)\n\nBefore setup:\n\n![Before setup](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/0b0fd21839f5504f114603b71e25c951b94c4363/1390/before-setup.png)\n\nAfter setup:\n\n![After setup](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/0b0fd21839f5504f114603b71e25c951b94c4363/1390/after-setup.png)\n\n## Cause\n\nThe engine supports Explain, but the post pages do not offer its switch.\nThe MCP tools already expose the option for the document and named setups.\n\n## Tests\n\nBoth new structural pins failed on unchanged production code because the checkbox was missing.\nBoth pass after the fix:\n\n- `explain_on_the_document_post_page_is_undoable`\n- `explain_on_the_setup_post_page_leaves_other_setups_unchanged`\n\nThe pins check the accessible role, name, and checked state.\nThey check undo, redo, and setup isolation.\nAn original tiny CPS fixture posts one G21 block with and without Explain.\nThe pins check that only the comment changes and the executable text stays equal.\n\nAll five existing `mcp_post_options` tests pass.\nThe extended `set_post_options_on_setup2_leaves_setup1_and_document_unchanged_and_undo_restores` test sets Explain on a named setup and reads it back.\nIt checks that the document and other setup stay unchanged, undo clears the override, and redo restores it.\n\nMutations:\n\n- Restoring upstream `post_options.rs` failed to compile with E0425 because the helper was missing. Restoring the fix passed both pins.\n- Restoring upstream `pages.rs` failed at runtime because the checkbox was missing. Restoring the fix passed both pins.\n- Omitting the pending command failed at runtime because Explain stayed false after the click. Restoring the command passed both pins.\n\ncargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main: green, two steps and zero failures.\nThe gate ran the UI library and six integration binaries, plus the changed MCP named-setup pin.\ncargo clippy -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings: green, no warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nNo G-code or CL golden changed.\nNo snapshot PNG changed.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNative window interaction, a machine or controller run, and release pixel snapshots were not exercised.\nThe UI pins and review images use egui_kittest offscreen.\nThe posting fixture contains one original G21 block; it does not exercise a full machining program.\nThe engine already has shipped dialect tests.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n#2029 changes tool_page and tool_editor_window in pages.rs: touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\n#1931 changes the WCS branch of properties in pages.rs: touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\n#1717 changes the WCS branch of properties in pages.rs: touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\n#1209 changes WCS properties, wcs_page, and apply_wcs_drafts in pages.rs: touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nThis PR changes post_section.\n\nChangelog: Add an undoable Explain G-code switch to document and setup post pages, with a longer-program notice.\n\nFixes #1390\n",
